    "id": "sec-1",
    "kind": "cloze",
    "displayName": "语法填空",
    "partLabel": "一",
    "directions": {
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "markdown",
       "value": "根据上下文和所给词提示完成短文填空。"
      }
     ]
    },
    "sharedChoices": [],
    "materials": [
     {
      "blocks": [
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": "Not long ago, traveling in China felt like a race. Young people used to talk "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g1",
        "placeholder": "1"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " about how they visited countless places in a very short time with little rest. This \"boot camp\" style of travel "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g2",
        "placeholder": "2"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " then as a mark of honor."
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": ""
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": "Today, however, "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g3",
        "placeholder": "3"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " new kind of travel is changing everything. It is called \"slow travel\", in which a traveler "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g4",
        "placeholder": "4"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " on experience rather than speed. Instead of rushing everywhere, travelers choose fewer places and stay "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g5",
        "placeholder": "5"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " at each place. According to a 2025 survey, over $53\\%$ of young people preferred this relaxed style, "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g6",
        "placeholder": "6"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " independent trips over busy group tours."
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": ""
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": "This shift is changing the tourist industry. For example, attractions "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g7",
        "placeholder": "7"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " Guangdong are being redesigned for a slower pace. On Foshan's Xiqiao Mountain, there is even a \"gentle\" bungee jump for those "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g8",
        "placeholder": "8"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " want to enjoy the experience without the terrifying drop. Hotels are also adapting by offering both later checkout times "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g9",
        "placeholder": "9"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " large rooms. Instead of hurrying to famous landmarks, "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "g10",
        "placeholder": "10"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " are spending more time in museums and historical streets to feel the charm of a city."
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
