      "stem": {
       "blocks": [
        {
         "type": "markdown",
         "value": "假如你是新华学院的学生李华，请用英文给已回英国的交换生 Sarah 发信息，介绍学校最近的变化。\n内容包括：\n（1）表达对她的想念；\n（2）介绍学校的变化；\n（3）欢迎她有机会再回来看看。\n注意：\n（1）词数不少于40；\n（2）不得出现考生的真实姓名及学校名；\n（3）格式不做要求。"
        }
       ]
      },
      "interaction": {
       "type": "long_text",
       "target": "essay1",
       "placeholder": "请在此作答",
       "minWords": 40
      },
      "answerSpec": {
       "type": "manual_only"
      },
      "analysis": {
       "blocks": [
        {
         "type": "markdown",
         "value": "写作时应覆盖思念、校园变化和欢迎回访三个要点，语言得体，时态以一般现在时为主。"
        }
       ]
      },
      "referenceAnswer": {
       "blocks": [
        {
         "type": "markdown",
         "value": "Dear Sarah,\nI miss you very much. Our school has changed a lot recently. We now have a new library and more after-school activities, and the playground looks much nicer than before. The classrooms are also brighter and more modern. I hope you can come back and visit our school again when you have time.\nBest wishes,\nLi Hua"
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ]
   }
